# Copy to infra/secrets/ch_password (gitignored) and replace the line below with
# the password for the user named by `clickhouse.user`. The real file holds ONE
# line and no comments. Mounted 0400; deployed, it is a projected volume from a
# managed secret store — never an env var, never a build arg (SPEC §14.2).
#
# Only *.example may be COMMITTED here. Your local `ch_password` is gitignored and
# is supposed to exist — the root stack mounts it into the collector and flow-ui,
# and `make migrate` refuses to run without it.
# scripts/ci/invariants.d/04-no-plaintext-secrets.sh reads `git ls-files`, not the
# filesystem, so it fails only if a non-example file is actually tracked.
replace-me
